// The cast list: everything the story uses that the game provides. Pibbles checks
// every name the story uses against it, so a typo is caught before anyone plays.
// Lines starting with // are comments, notes for whoever reads the script.

// A character. Lines of dialogue start with their ID: `guide: Hello!`
// `name:` is the name the player sees, and `poses:` lists how they can look.
// The first pose is where they start.
@actor guide
    name: Guide
    poses: neutral, happy

// A variable: something the story remembers, saved with the game.
@var $asked_for_help = false
